<section class="panel cp-intro cp-span-full">
    <h2>What is Classic+?</h2>
    <p>Classic+ is the community's term for a new expansion of WoW Classic — new zones, raids, classes and systems layered on the Vanilla world instead of a re-release. Blizzard's China-only <strong>Titan Reforged</strong> (level-80 Vanilla/TBC/Wrath merge) is widely read as the working prototype, and datamined store licenses point to an internal project codenamed <strong>Project Camelot</strong>, expected to be revealed at <a href="https://blizzcon.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BlizzCon 2026</a> (Sept 12-13, Anaheim) alongside the next retail expansion announcement.</p>
</section>

