<section class="panel cp-span-full">
    <h2>Why Classic+?</h2>
    <p>Classic's seasonal model has run its course. The progressive re-releases have carried the game through to Mists of Pandaria, original Vanilla servers receive no new content, and the one-off seasons — Season of Mastery, Hardcore and Season of Discovery — all ended. Players chasing the original experience have been pushed toward private servers, and the takedowns of the largest ones clear the field for an official product. Classic+ is that product: a permanent, evolving version of the original world rather than another season.</p>
</section>

