    <ul class="plain-list">
        <li>Rune-based class system reworking Vanilla builds</li>
        <li>Level-gated phases that unlocked content together</li>
        <li>New content deliberately hidden from dataminers so players discovered it as a community</li>
        <li>New and revamped dungeons and raids layered on the Vanilla world</li>
        <li>Final update confirmed in 2025 — the seasonal experiment is over</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="meta-info">Season of Discovery is the closest thing to a Classic+ prototype; demand for a permanent version is exactly the gap Classic+ would fill.</p>
